{
    "title": "Breaking News & Latest Stories",
    "description": "HomePage News delivers the latest US news, breaking news, & headlines from around the world. This smart news app gives you a user-friendly search experience & one-swipe access to the day's headlines from top sources. Easily access trending stories via a shortcut from your home screen.\r\n\r\nWhy you'll love HomePage News:\r\n\u2713 One-swipe access to US & world news\r\n\u2713 Device search via the app drawer and search bars\r\n\u2713 Finance, entertainment, sports, weather news, & more\r\n\u2713 Latest news stories from top sources\r\n\u2713 Instant access to top news videos\r\n\u2713 Enhanced home screen\r\n\u2713 Custom web search\r\n\u2713 Enhanced voice search functionality\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Easy-to-use news launcher: Enjoy a seamless homescreen experience. Get one swipe access to breaking US news. Browse better with the customized web search feature.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1Device search: Easily access your favorite apps. Perform a device search for applications via the app drawer and multiple search touchpoints within the app \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf0Instant news access: Make HomePage News your go-to app to stay informed. Swipe right from your homescreen to watch current US news, read top headlines, & track the latest developments in trending stories as they unfold. Read in-depth reports across a range of topics.\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fNews from trusted sources: Access breaking news stories & trending news videos from popular providers. Select your favorite news providers so that their stories appear first & more frequently. Enjoy greater control over your news feed.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0eDaily news highlights: Tap the News Stories icon on your homescreen for a quick news roundup. Skip the news feed & catch up on current US & foreign affairs via news stories.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udea6News across popular categories: Never miss a story! Get round-the-clock updates from the world of finance, entertainment, weather, science, technology, sports, & more.\r\n\r\n\u26c5Daily weather updates at your fingertips: Swipe right on your homescreen to view the current temperature for your location. Plus, access weather information for the previous day & the following five days.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0eCustomized web search: Searching for anything online couldn't be easier. With our new search functionality, you can find exactly what you're looking for - images, videos, or information - in a snap. Activate the voice search feature by tapping the microphone icon on the homescreen search bar.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10In-app browser shortcut: Our lightning-fast browser makes browsing a breeze. Search for the latest news articles & information on topics you find interesting.\r\n\r\nHomePage News is a free news app that makes news reading more convenient than ever. Along with great news features, it also offers new search functionality & an improved homescreen. It's truly an all-in-one app for all ages.\r\n\r\nSimple, quick setup: Get faster, one-swipe access to the day's headlines. Download the lightweight app, finish the install, & swipe right on your home screen or tap the News Stories icon to view the top stories in the US today.\r\n\r\n100% free installation: Enjoy an evolved home screen experience with this fast, free, all-in-one news launcher app. No additional charges & no complicated signup procedure.\r\n\r\nWe would love to hear your feedback. If you have queries, complaints, or suggestions, please send us an email. Should you no longer wish to use this app, it can be uninstalled at any time.\r\nUpon clicking the button above, you agree to the Terms & Conditions & Privacy Policy & give your consent to install this product from the Google Play\u2122 Store.\r\nAll third-party names (including company & service names), celebrity names, & images used here are trademarks, registered trademarks, or properties of their owners. Use of them here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by their respective holders.\r\nGoogle Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.\r\nTerms & Conditions: https://homepagenews.co/homepagenews/termsofservice.html\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://homepagenews.co/homepagenews/privacypolicy.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "HomePage News delivers the latest US news, breaking news, &amp; headlines from around the world. This smart news app gives you a user-friendly search experience &amp; one-swipe access to the day&#39;s headlines from top sources. Easily access trending stories via a shortcut from your home screen.<br><br>Why you&#39;ll love HomePage News:<br>\u2713 One-swipe access to US &amp; world news<br>\u2713 Device search via the app drawer and search bars<br>\u2713 Finance, entertainment, sports, weather news, &amp; more<br>\u2713 Latest news stories from top sources<br>\u2713 Instant access to top news videos<br>\u2713 Enhanced home screen<br>\u2713 Custom web search<br>\u2713 Enhanced voice search functionality<br><br>Key Features:<br><br>\ud83d\ude80 Easy-to-use news launcher: Enjoy a seamless homescreen experience. Get one swipe access to breaking US news. Browse better with the customized web search feature.<br><br>\ud83d\udcf1Device search: Easily access your favorite apps. Perform a device search for applications via the app drawer and multiple search touchpoints within the app <br><br>\ud83d\udcf0Instant news access: Make HomePage News your go-to app to stay informed. Swipe right from your homescreen to watch current US news, read top headlines, &amp; track the latest developments in trending stories as they unfold. Read in-depth reports across a range of topics.<br><br>\u2714\ufe0fNews from trusted sources: Access breaking news stories &amp; trending news videos from popular providers. Select your favorite news providers so that their stories appear first &amp; more frequently. Enjoy greater control over your news feed.<br><br>\ud83c\udf0eDaily news highlights: Tap the News Stories icon on your homescreen for a quick news roundup. Skip the news feed &amp; catch up on current US &amp; foreign affairs via news stories.<br><br>\ud83d\udea6News across popular categories: Never miss a story! Get round-the-clock updates from the world of finance, entertainment, weather, science, technology, sports, &amp; more.<br><br>\u26c5Daily weather updates at your fingertips: Swipe right on your homescreen to view the current temperature for your location. Plus, access weather information for the previous day &amp; the following five days.<br><br>\ud83d\udd0eCustomized web search: Searching for anything online couldn&#39;t be easier. With our new search functionality, you can find exactly what you&#39;re looking for - images, videos, or information - in a snap. Activate the voice search feature by tapping the microphone icon on the homescreen search bar.<br><br>\ud83c\udf10In-app browser shortcut: Our lightning-fast browser makes browsing a breeze. Search for the latest news articles &amp; information on topics you find interesting.<br><br>HomePage News is a free news app that makes news reading more convenient than ever. Along with great news features, it also offers new search functionality &amp; an improved homescreen. It&#39;s truly an all-in-one app for all ages.<br><br>Simple, quick setup: Get faster, one-swipe access to the day&#39;s headlines. Download the lightweight app, finish the install, &amp; swipe right on your home screen or tap the News Stories icon to view the top stories in the US today.<br><br>100% free installation: Enjoy an evolved home screen experience with this fast, free, all-in-one news launcher app. No additional charges &amp; no complicated signup procedure.<br><br>We would love to hear your feedback. If you have queries, complaints, or suggestions, please send us an email. Should you no longer wish to use this app, it can be uninstalled at any time.<br>Upon clicking the button above, you agree to the Terms &amp; Conditions &amp; Privacy Policy &amp; give your consent to install this product from the Google Play\u2122 Store.<br>All third-party names (including company &amp; service names), celebrity names, &amp; images used here are trademarks, registered trademarks, or properties of their owners. Use of them here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by their respective holders.<br>Google Play is a trademark of Google LLC. Use of it here does not imply any affiliation with or endorsement by Google LLC.<br>Terms &amp; Conditions: https://homepagenews.co/homepagenews/termsofservice.html<br>Privacy Policy: https://homepagenews.co/homepagenews/privacypolicy.html",
